# Pairs with CausalOrder. The check ignores the writes held back unapplied - parked, dead-lettered or
# lost - so a dependency below S that the receiver acknowledged without applying is treated as met.
MODULE: CausalOrderHeldBackOmitted
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a dependency below S that is held back unapplied is treated as met
PERTURBS: ReceiveB

--- FIND
       /\ IF t \in lost \/ DepsOk(t)
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: held-back writes are not excluded.
       /\ IF t \in lost \/ t \in ids \/ t < srcv
--- END
